\">tu contraseña.</span></h1>\\n            <p class=\\\"t-body\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 4px;font-family:'DM Mono',Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#55556a;\\\">Hola {{NOMBRE}}, recibimos una solicitud para restablecer la contraseña de tu cuenta. Pulsa el botón para crear una nueva. Usas la misma contraseña en todo el ecosistema.</p>\\n          </td></tr></table>\\n\\n          <!-- app chip -->\\n          <table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:20px 34px 0;\\\">\\n            <table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"soft\\\" style=\\\"background:#f4f6f8;border:1px solid #e4e6ea;border-radius:11px;\\\"><tr>\\n              <td style=\\\"padding:9px 14px 9px 11px;font-family:'DM Mono',Menlo,monospace;\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"t-faint\\\" style=\\\"font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8a99;\\\">Solicitado desde</span><br>\\n                <span class=\\\"t-strong\\\" style=\\\"font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;color:#15151f;\\\">Calculadora de Viabilidad Inmobiliaria Pro</span>\\n              </td>\\n            </tr></table>\\n          </td></tr></table>\\n\\n          <!-- CTA -->\\n          <table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:24px 34px 4px;\\\">\\n            <table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\"><tr>\\n              <td style=\\\"border-radius:13px;background:#C6A87F;\\\">\\n                <a href=\\\"{{RESET_LINK}}\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;padding:16px 30px;font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.2px;color:#ffffff;border-radius:13px;\\\">Crear nueva contraseña &rarr;</a>\\n              </td>\\n            </tr></table>\\n          </td></tr></table>\\n          <table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:12px 34px 0;\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"t-faint\\\" style=\\\"margin:0;font-family:'DM Mono',Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.4px;color:#8a8a99;\\\">◷ Este enlace vence en 60 minutos y solo puede usarse una vez.</p>\\n          </td></tr></table>\\n\\n          <!-- fallback -->\\n          <table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:22px 34px 0;\\\">\\n            <table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"soft\\\" style=\\\"background:#f4f6f8;border:1px solid #e4e6ea;border-radius:12px;\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"padding:14px 16px;font-family:'DM Mono',Menlo,monospace;\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"t-faint\\\" style=\\\"font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8a99;margin-bottom:6px;\\\">Si el botón no funciona, copia este enlace</div>\\n              <a href=\\\"{{RESET_LINK}}\\\" style=\\\"color:#1499c9;font-size:11.5px;word-break:break-all;\\\">{{RESET_LINK}}</a>\\n            </td></tr></table>\\n          </td></tr></table>\\n\\n          <!-- security -->\\n          <table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:20px 34px 0;\\\">\\n            <table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"soft\\\" style=\\\"background:#f4f6f8;border:1px solid #e4e6ea;border-radius:12px;\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"padding:14px 16px;font-family:'DM Mono',Menlo,monospace;\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"t-mut\\\" style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#5d5d6c;\\\"><b style=\\\"color:inheri